D1. What Solomon was in spite of his matrimonial adventures. (Two words.) ~ WISEGUY
D2. Famous garden. ~ EDEN
D3. A metal. ~ LEAD
D4. Something the sheik said he'd walk a mile for when his flivver broke down. ~ CAMEL
D5. Island suitable for an old maid's home. ~ MAN
D6. Webster says "black." ~ EBON
