D8. Crossword puzzle fish. ~ EEL
D9. First victim of "speak for yourself John." ~ ALDEN
D10. These always come out all right in the end. ~ TOES
D11. An architectural molding that sounds like a cry of joy. ~ OGEE
D12. This broke up a nice garden party. ~ REPTILE
D15. Place where you'll find some queer looking birds. ~ AVIARY
